    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poisons</a></i> </p><p><i>Dioxis is an inhaled gas often used in assassinations.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Dioxis_Statistics_.28CL_8.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dioxis_Statistics_(CL_8)\">Dioxis Statistics (CL 8)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Atmosphere, Natural, Poison </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature is exposed to Dioxis. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +10 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round at the start of the target's turn, until the Dioxis is treated. </p><p><b>Suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b>&nbsp;The following are suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>&nbsp;for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> (DC 23; Requires <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medical_Kit\" title=\"Medical Kit\">Medical Kit</a>):</b> The character treats the Dioxis.</li>\n</ul>",
